 da's forests\, springs\, beaches and wetlands\, learn where the name La Fl
 orida came from\, and make a Florida state butterfly to take home. The sam
 e lesson is taught Monday and Tuesday\, and it is a drop-off class\, so st
 udents bring their own lunch.\n\nPrice: from $50\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-ecsc-homeschool-wild-florida-1116.html
