DESCRIPTION:Mon 11/23\, Tue 11/24\, Wed 11/25 and Fri 11/27 · 10:00 AM to 
 3:00 PM\n\nThe science center runs a fall break program on four days\, wit
 h new activities each day. Kids make a glowing pumpkin squishy circuit\, a
  corn snake maze\, pumpkin slime or a pumpkin chemistry experiment\, depen
 ding on the day. A Creature Feature with the animal ambassadors and sciPad
  fall games run alongside. The museum is closed Thanksgiving Day.\n\nPrice
 : from $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ecsc-fall-fo
 r-all-1123.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ecsc-fall-for-all-1123.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
